### Get all cats
GET http://localhost:3000/cats
x-auth-token: mytoken123
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "example": "GET /cats"
}

### create cat 
POST http://localhost:3000/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Kitty 2",
    "age": 2,
    "breed": "Kampung"
}

### get cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/cats/1

### update cat
PUT http://localhost:3000/cats/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Kitty xxx",
    "age": 30
}

### delete cat
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cats/1

### get test
GET http://localhost:3000/test/cats
